{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI write from Koblenz, where the air is thick with the heat of the Rhine. I have just taken a bath to wash away the dust of the road; it is the first relief I have felt since leaving Kassel. The journey to Marburg was brief but necessary, and I was glad to see Suabedissen, though we had little time. In Wetzlar, however, I found true rest. Schulz’s family received me with such warmth that I spent the whole afternoon and evening among them. This morning he walked me through the town, showing me its quiet corners, before seeing me onto the mail coach.\n\nI think of you and the boys constantly. Berlin feels far away, yet my heart remains there. I hope the heat has not been too oppressive for you. I shall continue on, but for now, I am content to sit here by the river, snuff in hand, and rest my mind.\n\nYour loving,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080650,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":208,"prompt_tokens":953,"total_tokens":1161,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-8dvwPnqLN8HZFQDO5SPFwKFfajrrAddR","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":953,"prompt_ms":931.618,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9775634837355719,"prompt_per_second":1022.9514672322777,"predicted_n":208,"predicted_ms":4920.223,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.769193236714976,"predicted_per_second":42.07126384312256}}